      "message": "[error] Line 789: 🔴 `remoteAllowsRtcpMux` below still indexes `remoteSession_-\u003emedia[mediaIndex]` directly, while `remoteMedia` now resolves `mediaIndex` against only enabled remote m-lines. With a rejected m-line before an active one, this checks `rtcp-mux` on the wrong media (for example, omitting mux when the active video offer has it, or advertising mux when it does not), which can make the RTP/RTCP component setup disagree with the offer. Reuse `remoteMedia` or the same enabled-media lookup for this check as well.",
